@startuml
!include style.iuml
' Live monitoring of one session (Modules 5/10). One fork, one branch per concurrent loop, each branch in one lane;
' the lanes talk through send-signal (>) and accept-event (<) actions; a join closes the fork.
' Desktop: LiveMonitoringService heartbeat Timer (AppConfig.HeartbeatSeconds = 10) whose ack carries remainingSeconds,
'   sessionStatus, up to 5 warnings, unlockedUntilUtc and capture settings; 1 s tick: EvidenceCaptureService.Tick
'   (CaptureSchedule: mean ScreenshotIntervalSeconds x U[0.5,1.5)), EventBatcher flush every 5 s or at once when urgent
'   (POST /api/monitoring/events/batch), capture upload every 5 s (POST /api/monitoring/screenshots, kind Screen|Webcam);
'   LockdownCoordinator / focus loss / WebcamMonitorService.IssueChanged -> urgent event in the encrypted MonitoringSpool
'   + CaptureForViolation (webcam issues also give a webcam snapshot).
' Server: MonitoringController.Heartbeat (MarkAlive, SeatGuard re-check, ViolationClassifier.Classify -> tileStatus,
'   StudentHeartbeat), PushEventBatch (ClientEventId dedup, ViolationClassifier.Resolve, audit MONITORING_VIOLATION,
'   ViolationEvent for fresh violations), UploadScreenshot (30/min cap, WEBCAM_NOT_REQUIRED, ScreenshotUploaded);
'   MonitoringHub SendWarning / ExtendStudentTime / UnlockSession / ForceSubmitSessionById (access check, audit);
'   HeartbeatWatchdogService sweep every 5 s: InProgress, !IsDisconnected, silent 30 s -> Disconnected event,
'   audit SESSION_DISCONNECTED, StudentDisconnected.
' Web panel: LiveMonitorPage JoinExamGroup(examId), tiles Stable / Warning / Suspicious / Critical / Disconnected.
' Sized for a landscape (sidewaysfigure) page. Printed pt = fontSize * 72 * printed_width_in / png_width_px.
skinparam dpi 96
skinparam defaultFontSize 28
skinparam ArrowFontSize 27
skinparam padding 1
skinparam swimlane {
  BorderColor #777777
  TitleFontSize 29
}
|Desktop App|
|Server|
|Web Panel (staff)|

|Desktop App|
start
:Session starts:
lockdown on,
webcam monitor
if RequireWebcam;
fork
  |Web Panel (staff)|
  :JoinExamGroup
  (examId);
  repeat
    :Push: update
    tile, alerts,
    thumbnails<
    if (Staff acts?) then ([yes])
      :Warn, extend,
      unlock or
      force-submit
      (hub call)>
    else ([no])
    endif
  repeat while (InProgress?) is ([yes]) not ([no])
fork again
  |Server|
  repeat
    :Request<
    switch (Kind?)
    case ([heartbeat])
      :Mark alive,
      re-check seat,
      tile status
      (Violation
      Classifier), ack;
    case ([batch, capture])
      :Store events
      (dedup, audit
      MONITORING_
      VIOLATION) or
      Screenshot;
    case ([hub call])
      :Check access,
      store, audit,
      next ack
      carries it;
    endswitch
    :Push to the
    exam group>
  repeat while (InProgress?) is ([yes]) not ([no])
fork again
  |Server|
  repeat
    :Watchdog
    sweep (5 s);
    if (Not flagged,
    silent 30 s?) then ([yes])
      :Disconnected,
      audit SESSION_
      DISCONNECTED,
      push
      StudentDisconnected>
    else ([no])
    endif
  repeat while (InProgress?) is ([yes]) not ([no])
fork again
  |Desktop App|
  repeat
    :POST heartbeat
    every 10 s>
    :Ack: warnings,
    time, status,
    unlock<
  repeat while (InProgress?) is ([yes]) not ([no])
fork again
  repeat
    :Every 1 s:
    screenshot
    when due (0.5
    to 1.5 x interval);
    :Send outbox to
    events/batch
    (5 s, at once
    if urgent),
    upload captures>
  repeat while (InProgress?) is ([yes]) not ([no])
fork again
  repeat
    :Lockdown, focus
    or webcam flag<
    :Queue in the
    encrypted outbox
    (urgent), capture
    the screen (webcam
    issue: snapshot);
  repeat while (InProgress?) is ([yes]) not ([no])
end fork
:Stop monitoring,
deliver the rest;
stop
@enduml
